{"seq":3,"slug":"coupon-effect-analytics","title":"券拉新/转化/核销效果归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/coupon-center-lifecycle/lifecycle-ops/coupon-effect-analytics","wordCount":3576,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"券拉新-转化-核销效果归因\">券拉新/转化/核销效果归因</h1><p>活动结束后运营最想知道的三个数字是：这批券带来了多少新用户、提升了多少转化、花掉的预算换回了多少 GMV。这三个问题的难点不在统计，而在<strong>因果</strong>：领了券的人本来就会下单，把他们的订单算作券的成果，会把营销效果虚高好几倍；而完全没有领券的人里也有一部分是被优惠信息吸引来的，把他们排除在外会低估效果。归因系统要做的就是从观测数据里剥离出「券带来的增量」。</p>\n<p>本文处理归因与度量：实验设计、增量口径、分渠道拆分、以及归因结果如何反馈到预算与投放决策。券的核销数据来源见 <a href=\"writeoff-recovery\">核销、退回与风控防刷</a>；发放侧的渠道维度见 <a href=\"../grant-wallet/distribution-channels\">多渠道发券</a>；提醒触达的增量度量见 <a href=\"expire-remind\">过期提醒与续券</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-归因的三种口径与各自能回答的问题\">核心概念：归因的三种口径与各自能回答的问题</h2><p>归因口径不是技术选择，而是问题定义。三种口径回答三个不同的问题，混用会产生互相矛盾的报告：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>系统性偏差</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量归因</td>\n<td>领券用户中所有订单的 GMV</td>\n<td>「这批券触达的人花了多少」</td>\n<td>高估（含自然购买）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量归因</td>\n<td>领券组与对照组的差异</td>\n<td>「券额外带来了多少」</td>\n<td>无偏（需实验支撑）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本归因</td>\n<td>让利额 ÷ 增量 GMV</td>\n<td>「每一元让利换来多少 GMV」</td>\n<td>依赖增量口径的准确性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对账时不应把三个口径的数字放在同一张表里比较。正确做法是<strong>以增量归因为决策依据、以全量归因做规模描述、以成本归因做效率评估</strong>，并在报表上显式标注口径。混口径的报表是营销团队与财务团队长期争吵的常见根因——一边在看全量 GMV、一边在看净成本，双方都觉得自己在说同一件事。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    POP[&quot;目标人群&quot;] --&gt; RAND[&quot;随机分组&quot;]&#10;    RAND --&gt; T[&quot;实验组&lt;br/&gt;发券&quot;]&#10;    RAND --&gt; C[&quot;对照组&lt;br/&gt;不发券&quot;]&#10;    T --&gt; OBS_T[&quot;观测:GMV / 订单数 / 新客数&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; OBS_C[&quot;观测:GMV / 订单数 / 新客数&quot;]&#10;    OBS_T --&gt; LIFT[&quot;增量计算&lt;br/&gt;处理效应&quot;]&#10;    OBS_C --&gt; LIFT&#10;    LIFT --&gt; SEG[&quot;分层:新客 / 老客 / 市场 / 渠道&quot;]&#10;    SEG --&gt; COST[&quot;效率:让利额 ÷ 增量&quot;]&#10;    COST --&gt; DEC[&quot;预算分配与投放决策&quot;]&#10;    DEC --&gt; NEXT[&quot;下一轮实验设计&quot;]&#10;    NEXT --&gt; RAND\">graph TD\n    POP[\"目标人群\"] --&gt; RAND[\"随机分组\"]\n    RAND --&gt; T[\"实验组&lt;br/&gt;发券\"]\n    RAND --&gt; C[\"对照组&lt;br/&gt;不发券\"]\n    T --&gt; OBS_T[\"观测:GMV / 订单数 / 新客数\"]\n    C --&gt; OBS_C[\"观测:GMV / 订单数 / 新客数\"]\n    OBS_T --&gt; LIFT[\"增量计算&lt;br/&gt;处理效应\"]\n    OBS_C --&gt; LIFT\n    LIFT --&gt; SEG[\"分层:新客 / 老客 / 市场 / 渠道\"]\n    SEG --&gt; COST[\"效率:让利额 ÷ 增量\"]\n    COST --&gt; DEC[\"预算分配与投放决策\"]\n    DEC --&gt; NEXT[\"下一轮实验设计\"]\n    NEXT --&gt; RAND</pre><p>图中最后一条边（决策回流到实验设计）是让归因产生价值的必要条件。没有它的归因系统只是一个报表工具，而报表不会自动改变下一轮的投放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实验设计-随机化的层级与常见陷阱\">实验设计：随机化的层级与常见陷阱</h2><p>增量归因的基础是随机对照。随机化的<strong>单元</strong>决定了实验能回答什么问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>随机化单元</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户级</td>\n<td>定向发券、会员券</td>\n<td>干扰最小</td>\n<td>社交/家庭共享导致溢出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场级</td>\n<td>全站活动、大促</td>\n<td>无用户间干扰</td>\n<td>样本量小、市场间不可比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间级（开关）</td>\n<td>无法分流的活动</td>\n<td>覆盖全量</td>\n<td>时间趋势与处理效应混淆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类目/商品级</td>\n<td>品类券</td>\n<td>无用户干扰</td>\n<td>用户的跨类目行为导致溢出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>用户级随机是默认选择，但有两个必须处理的偏差：</p>\n<p><strong>偏差一：溢出（spillover）。</strong> 若实验组的用户把券分享给对照组的家人，对照组的核销率会被抬高，从而低估增量。防法是识别家庭/共享设备并做<strong>整簇随机化</strong>（同一设备簇内的用户分到同一组）。识别簇本身有成本，只在券可分享的活动中启用。</p>\n<p><strong>偏差二：样本比例失衡与提前窥探。</strong> 实验未结束就看结果并据此停止，会大幅提高假阳性率（即著名的「偷看问题」）。工程上的防法是让实验平台强制记录<strong>预注册的最小样本量与持续时长</strong>，未达到时不给显著性结论，只展示趋势。这个偏差的量级很可观：在两组真实无差异的情况下，每观测一次就做一次显著性检验并伺机停止，假阳性率可高达 26.1%，是名义 5% 的五倍以上；偷看 10 次会让报出的 1% 显著性实际只相当于约 5%（来源：Evan Miller, How Not To Run an A/B Test, <a href=\"https://www.evanmiller.org/how-not-to-run-an-ab-test.html）。另一道标准护栏是样本比例失衡（SRM）检验：实际分组比例与预期显著不符时（常用卡方拟合优度检验），说明分流或埋点有缺陷，应直接作废该实验的结论（来源：Sample\">https://www.evanmiller.org/how-not-to-run-an-ab-test.html）。另一道标准护栏是样本比例失衡（SRM）检验：实际分组比例与预期显著不符时（常用卡方拟合优度检验），说明分流或埋点有缺陷，应直接作废该实验的结论（来源：Sample</a> ratio mismatch, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sample_ratio_mismatch）。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sample_ratio_mismatch）。</a></p>\n<p>样品量与可检测的最小效应量关系是设计实验的核心公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\approx \\frac{2\\,(z_{1-\\alpha/2} + z_{1-\\beta})^2 \\,\\sigma^2}{\\Delta^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2453em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5593em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7452em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是期望检测到的增量、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是指标标准差。这一形式即两组等样本量、双侧检验下每组所需样本量的标准近似式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\approx 2\\,(z_{\\alpha/2}+z_{1-\\beta})^2\\sigma^2/\\Delta^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1052em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1002em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，样本量与效应量的平方成反比（来源：Sample size determination, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sample_size_determination）。这个公式给出一个实用的直觉：**要检测的效应越小，所需样本量按平方增长**。因此「检测\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sample_size_determination）。这个公式给出一个实用的直觉：**要检测的效应越小，所需样本量按平方增长**。因此「检测</a> 2% 的提升」通常需要看不下去的大样本，而「检测 15% 的提升」只需要万级样本。运营提出「帮我测出这批券有没有 1% 的效果」时，正确的回答是先算出所需样本量并说明代价，而不是直接开跑然后给出一个不可信的结论。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>期望检测的提升</th>\n<th>相对样本量</th>\n<th>典型可用性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>30%</td>\n<td>基准 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>万级样本即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9\\,n_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>十万级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>36</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">36\\,n_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>数十万级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>900</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">900\\,n_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">900</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>通常不可行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三种效果的独立度量\">三种效果的独立度量</h2><p>拉新、转化、核销是三个不同的指标，它们的度量方式不能共用一套。把它们混成一个「ROI」会掩盖真正的结构问题。</p>\n<p><strong>拉新效应。</strong> 新客的定义必须与实验组无关且可复现——通常取「实验开始前 N 天无购买记录」的判定。常见错误是把「首次在本渠道购买」当成新客，这会把仅换渠道购买的老客算成新客。拉新的增量表达为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>增量新客</mtext><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mi>C</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{增量新客} = N_T^{\\text{new}} - N_C^{\\text{new}} \\cdot \\frac{|T|}{|C|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">增量新客</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9614em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9614em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>转化效应。</strong> 转化率的提升要在<strong>可比的用户集合</strong>上比较。若实验组里的用户因为领券而更活跃，那么他们的曝光次数也更高，直接比较转化率会混淆「券的作用」与「曝光的增加」。可行做法是固定曝光口径：只统计实验期内至少有一次商品曝光的用户。</p>\n<p><strong>核销效应。</strong> 核销率的分母必须是<strong>领券数</strong>而不是发放数，两者在多渠道场景下不等（见 <a href=\"../grant-wallet/distribution-channels\">多渠道发券</a> 的流水状态）。核销率还应当按券的生命周期分段统计，因为核销集中发生在领券后的前 48 小时与到期前 24 小时，只看总核销率会掩盖这两个峰的强度差异。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>分子</th>\n<th>分母</th>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拉新增量</td>\n<td>新客数（实验组−对照组）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>新客定义随渠道变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转化增量</td>\n<td>下单用户数（组间差）</td>\n<td>有曝光用户数</td>\n<td>分母含无曝光用户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核销率</td>\n<td>核销券数</td>\n<td>领券数</td>\n<td>用发放数作分母</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>券 ROI</td>\n<td>增量 GMV</td>\n<td>让利额</td>\n<td>用全量 GMV 作分子</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分渠道与分市场的拆解\">分渠道与分市场的拆解</h2><p>总体的增量数字对决策的指导有限，因为投放决策是<strong>按渠道、按市场、按人群</strong>做的。拆解到一个可执行的粒度是归因系统的核心价值。</p>\n<p>拆解的维度与陷阱成对出现：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拆解维度</th>\n<th>可回答</th>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>渠道</td>\n<td>哪个入口的增量最高</td>\n<td>渠道间用户重叠，增量不可加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场</td>\n<td>哪个市场的效率最高</td>\n<td>市场客单价不可比，须用相对增量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人群（新/老）</td>\n<td>券对新客还是老客更有效</td>\n<td>新客样本少，需要更长实验期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>券种</td>\n<td>哪种券更有效</td>\n<td>券种与人群相关，混淆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时段</td>\n<td>何时投放更好</td>\n<td>时段与节日重叠</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>「渠道间增量不可加」<strong>是最需要向决策者解释的一条：同一个用户在多个渠道都可能看到券，分渠道的增量之和通常大于总体增量。因此分渠道数字用于</strong>排序</strong>（哪个渠道更高效）而不是用于<strong>加总</strong>（总共带来多少）。想要可加的口径，需要在渠道层面也做随机化——这在技术上可行但成本高，通常只在多渠道路由决策重要时才做。</p>\n<p>分市场比较必须用<strong>相对增量</strong>而非绝对增量。GMV 增量在市场间不可比（印尼盾与新加坡元的数值差距不是商业意义的差距），可比的量是「增量 GMV 占该市场基线 GMV 的比例」或「增量转化率的百分点差」。这与券的金额折算问题同源（见 <a href=\"../global-coupon/multi-currency-coupon\">多币种券金额与展示</a>）——绝对金额跨市场比较需要换算，而换算引入汇率噪声。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归因到预算-从度量到决策\">归因到预算：从度量到决策</h2><p>归因的最后一步是把结果变成预算分配。这一步容易做错，因为直觉上是「把预算给 ROI 最高的渠道」，而 ROI 最高的渠道往往是因为<strong>该渠道已有大量自然用户</strong>（ROI 高是因为分母小），继续加投的边际收益会迅速下降。</p>\n<p>正确的做法是按<strong>边际</strong>而非平均效率分配：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>边际效率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>增量 GMV</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>投放预算</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{边际效率} = \\frac{\\partial\\, \\text{增量 GMV}}{\\partial\\, \\text{投放预算}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">边际效率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">投放预算</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">增量</span><span class=\"mord\"> GMV</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>估计边际效率需要对同一渠道做<strong>多档预算实验</strong>（例如把预算设为现行水平的 50%、100%、150%），观察增量随预算的变化曲线。这条曲线通常是凹的（递减），因此最优分配点是各渠道边际效率相等的位置。这也是为什么「把全部预算给当前 ROI 最高的渠道」在实践中会失望：它在曲线上向右移动，边际收益会掉到其他渠道之下。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分配策略</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平均效率分配</td>\n<td>各渠道历史 ROI</td>\n<td>忽略递减，超投低效渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边际效率分配</td>\n<td>多档预算实验拟合曲线</td>\n<td>需要更多实验，短期成本高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定配额</td>\n<td>组织约定</td>\n<td>无效率信号，长期浪费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全给最优渠道</td>\n<td>单点最优</td>\n<td>边际递减后被反超</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>归因结果还需要回流到两个地方，否则它的价值只停留在报表上。<strong>第一是券的配置</strong>：如果某类券种的增量显著更高，下一轮的模板配置应调整权重（见 <a href=\"../coupon-model-batch/coupon-template-types\">券模板、券种与适用范围</a> 的券种分类，归因结果提供的是各类券的实证效率）。<strong>第二是预算池的设定</strong>：批次的预算量应当按上一轮测得的边际效率反推（见 <a href=\"../coupon-model-batch/batch-budget\">券批次、总量与预算</a>），而不是沿用历史数字。</p>\n<p>还有一个需要显式记录的限制：<strong>归因结果的有效期</strong>。券的增量效果高度依赖当时的竞争环境、用户对优惠的敏感度、以及平台自身的渗透率。一个在渗透率 5% 时测得的高增量，在渗透率 40% 时很难复现，因为容易拉的新客已经被拉完了。因此归因结论应当附带「测量时的基线条件」，并在环境变化后重新测量，而不是作为长期常数使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据质量与归因的可复现性\">数据质量与归因的可复现性</h2><p>最后一项工程要求：<strong>归因必须可复现</strong>。运营在三个月后问「当时那批券的效果是怎么算出来的」，系统必须能重新跑出同一个数字。这要求归因链路的所有输入都被固化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>固化方式</th>\n<th>缺失后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分组方案</td>\n<td>实验配置快照（含分组种子）</td>\n<td>无法重建实验组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观测窗口</td>\n<td>起止时间戳，绝对时间</td>\n<td>窗口漂移，数字变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>券范围</td>\n<td>批次与券 ID 集合</td>\n<td>新批次混入统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率版本</td>\n<td>快照 ID</td>\n<td>折算值不可复现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排除规则</td>\n<td>风控标记与异常订单清单版本</td>\n<td>每次跑的样本不同</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中最容易漏的是<strong>排除规则的版本</strong>。归因时通常会剔除异常订单（刷单、测试账号），而这份清单会随时间增加。若不记录当时使用的清单版本，重跑会得到不同的数字，而差异无法解释——这在对外汇报时是致命的。</p>\n<p>分组方案必须包含<strong>随机种子</strong>。用用户 ID 哈希取模分组是可复现的（同样的 ID 与模数总得到同样的组），而用数据库随机函数分组则不可复现。选择前者虽然会让「同一用户在不同实验中总在同一组」产生轻微的组间相关，但可复现性的价值更高，且可以通过加实验盐值来消除相关性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三种归因口径回答三个不同问题：<strong>增量归因做决策、全量归因描述规模、成本归因评估效率</strong>；同一张报表里不得混口径比较。</li>\n<li>增量必须靠随机对照；随机单元决定可回答的问题；需处理溢出（整簇随机）与偷看（预注册样本量与时长）。</li>\n<li>样本量按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\propto \\sigma^2 / \\Delta^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 增长，<strong>要检测的效应越小代价按平方上升</strong>，不可行的实验要提前说明代价而不是给不可信结论。</li>\n<li>拉新/转化/核销三指标各有各的分母陷阱；核销率分母必须是领券数，转化率分母必须限定有曝光的用户。</li>\n<li>分渠道增量<strong>不可加</strong>（只用于排序），分市场必须用<strong>相对增量</strong>而非绝对 GMV。</li>\n<li>预算按<strong>边际效率</strong>分配而非平均 ROI；归因结果回流到券种配置与批次预算，且结论须附带基线条件与有效期。</li>\n<li>归因链路的所有输入（分组种子、窗口、汇率版本、排除清单版本）都要固化，否则数字不可复现。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"券拉新/转化/核销效果归因","id":"券拉新-转化-核销效果归因"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：归因的三种口径与各自能回答的问题","id":"核心概念-归因的三种口径与各自能回答的问题"},{"level":2,"text":"实验设计：随机化的层级与常见陷阱","id":"实验设计-随机化的层级与常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"三种效果的独立度量","id":"三种效果的独立度量"},{"level":2,"text":"分渠道与分市场的拆解","id":"分渠道与分市场的拆解"},{"level":2,"text":"归因到预算：从度量到决策","id":"归因到预算-从度量到决策"},{"level":2,"text":"数据质量与归因的可复现性","id":"数据质量与归因的可复现性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"核销、退回与风控防刷","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/coupon-center-lifecycle/lifecycle-ops/writeoff-recovery"},"next":null}